      "text": "Generic path for any POST/PUT in any of the 5 services.  Each step is annotated with WHAT it does and WHY.\nSource: NextAurora.ServiceDefaults/Middleware/CorrelationIdMiddleware.cs · GlobalExceptionHandler.cs · each service's Program.cs",
