    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ann_pipe", "x": 700, "y": 760, "width": 480, "height": 240,
      "text": "(1) Validation: if any FluentValidation rule fails →\nValidationException → caught by GlobalExceptionHandler\n→ 400 ProblemDetails (per-field errors). Handler never runs.\n\n(2) Context propagation: opens logger.BeginScope so handler logs carry the correlation/user/session IDs. For async messages, the IDs are restored from envelope headers.\n\n(3) AutoApplyTransactions: detects the handler uses a DbContext, opens a transaction. Entity write + outbox-row write commit together at the end of the handler — see Diagram 3.",
      "originalText": "(1) Validation: if any FluentValidation rule fails →\nValidationException → caught by GlobalExceptionHandler\n→ 400 ProblemDetails (per-field errors). Handler never runs.\n\n(2) Context propagation: opens logger.BeginScope so handler logs carry the correlation/user/session IDs. For async messages, the IDs are restored from envelope headers.\n\n(3) AutoApplyTransactions: detects the handler uses a DbContext, opens a transaction. Entity write + outbox-row write commit together at the end of the handler — see Diagram 3.",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 200065, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 200066,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3
    },

