    {
      "type": "text", "id": "ann_handler", "x": 680, "y": 1040, "width": 480, "height": 70,
      "text": "Constructor-injected dependencies (repositories, IMessageBus, ICatalogClient for gRPC, ILogger).\nDomain methods enforce invariants (Order.Create, order.MarkAsPaid). Money is calculated server-side, never trusted from client. May cascade events (return an event → Wolverine publishes via outbox).",
      "originalText": "Constructor-injected dependencies (repositories, IMessageBus, ICatalogClient for gRPC, ILogger).\nDomain methods enforce invariants (Order.Create, order.MarkAsPaid). Money is calculated server-side, never trusted from client. May cascade events (return an event → Wolverine publishes via outbox).",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
