    {
      "type": "text", "id": "err_body", "x": 1220, "y": 440, "width": 350, "height": 310,
      "text": "Anywhere a handler throws, this catches it and emits RFC 7807 ProblemDetails. Every response includes traceId so server-side logs + client-reported errors connect.\n\n• ValidationException\n   → 400  Validation failed\n   + errors{} keyed by field\n\n• DbUpdateConcurrencyException\n   → 409  Concurrent modification\n   detail: 'Refetch and try again'\n\n• ArgumentException\n   → 400  Invalid request\n\n• InvalidOperationException\n   → 409  Operation not allowed\n   (e.g. order in wrong state for transition)\n\n• default (any other Exception)\n   → 500  An unexpected error occurred\n   detail: 'Please contact support with the trace ID'\n   (full details logged server-side, NEVER sent to client)",
      "originalText": "Anywhere a handler throws, this catches it and emits RFC 7807 ProblemDetails. Every response includes traceId so server-side logs + client-reported errors connect.\n\n• ValidationException\n   → 400  Validation failed\n   + errors{} keyed by field\n\n• DbUpdateConcurrencyException\n   → 409  Concurrent modification\n   detail: 'Refetch and try again'\n\n• ArgumentException\n   → 400  Invalid request\n\n• InvalidOperationException\n   → 409  Operation not allowed\n   (e.g. order in wrong state for transition)\n\n• default (any other Exception)\n   → 500  An unexpected error occurred\n   detail: 'Please contact support with the trace ID'\n   (full details logged server-side, NEVER sent to client)",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 400005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 400006,
      "isDeleted": false, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null,
      "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.3
    },

    {
      "type": "text", "id": "footer", "x": 40, "y": 1500, "width": 1500, "height": 50,
      "text": "Files: NextAurora.ServiceDefaults/{Middleware/CorrelationIdMiddleware.cs, Messaging/ContextPropagationMiddleware.cs, GlobalExceptionHandler.cs, Extensions.cs}, each service's Api/Program.cs + Api/Endpoints/*.cs, each service's Application/Handlers/*.cs.\nRelated diagrams: 3 (transactional outbox detail), 4 (EF Core query + write lifecycle).",
      "originalText": "Files: NextAurora.ServiceDefaults/{Middleware/CorrelationIdMiddleware.cs, Messaging/ContextPropagationMiddleware.cs, GlobalExceptionHandler.cs, Extensions.cs}, each service's Api/Program.cs + Api/Endpoints/*.cs, each service's Application/Handlers/*.cs.\nRelated diagrams: 3 (transactional outbox detail), 4 (EF Core query + write lifecycle).",
      "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#64748b", "backgroundColor": "transparent",
